<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 2.5em;">A STEP FORWARD, FROM HOME!</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="main-content">
    <div class="left-column">
      <div class="callout-box">
        <p>Earn your degree from your home!</p>
        <p>Whether in Nome or another regional community, Northwest Campus has the resources to support you on the path to your educational goals.</p>
        <p>NWC student Chase Gray is in Nome, completing coursework for a certificate in construction trades technology. Chase shares about his experience taking classes with NWC:</p>
        <p><strong>What elements of this program helped you to be successful?</strong></p>
        <p>The hands-on was a big part. I believe in do it, method of learning. We would do book work in the morning and hands-on in the afternoon, so it was applied.</p>
        <p><strong>What was an unexpected benefit of this program?</strong></p>
        <p>After taking the flooring and drywall class, I redid the floor in my house. It was really awesome.</p>
        <p><strong>Would you recommend others to do this program?</strong></p>
        <p>I would say, "Do it. It's never too late. I never thought I would be back in school after high school, and 20 years later, here I am."</p>
      </div>

      <div class="section-title">Where to start?</div>
      <p>Not sure how to make that first step? Northwest Campus advisors are available to help with everything from course selection to degree planning and more.</p>

      <div class="section-title">Degrees Close to Home</div>
      <ul>
        <li><span data-field="degree_home_1">Some UAF occupational endorsements, certificates, associate, bachelor's and graduate degrees are available entirely by distance or require minimum travel, including the following. Ask your advisor for more details, and visit <span data-field="degree_home_link">{{ degree_home_1">Some UAF occupational endorsements, certificates, associate, bachelor's and graduate degrees are available entirely by distance or require minimum travel, including the following. Ask your advisor for more details, and visit <span data-field= }}</span></span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="right-column">
      <div class="callout-box">
        <p>NWC CTT Faculty Ryan Ford demonstrates hands-on skills during a recent construction trades course.</p>
        <p>Don't hesitate to reach out and ask for resources, guidance, and encouragement.</p>
        <p><strong>Contact an advisor!</strong> See page 2 for advisor contact information or email: <span data-field="advisor_email">{{ advisor_email }}</span>. Want to call? In Nome, phone: <span data-field="advisor_phone">{{ advisor_phone }}</span>.</p>
        <p><strong>Outside Nome? Contact Kathy Comack, Program & Outreach Coordinator in Unalaska.</strong> Email: <span data-field="comack_email">{{ comack_email }}</span>, phone: <span data-field="comack_phone">{{ comack_phone }}</span>.</p>
        <p><strong>We're on social media!</strong> Stay informed about financial aid resources, training programs, regional UAF Northwest Campus and Bering Strait Higher Education Connection Facebook pages. Search #uafnwc and #fbshe to join! On Instagram, search for @uafnorthwestcampus.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="section-title">How to get started?</div>
      <p>Join NWC on the <span data-field="remind_app_link">{{ remind_app_link }}</span>! Sign up for academic reminders, financial aid reminders, and campus event info. Text <span data-field="remind_number">{{ remind_number }}</span> to 81010.</p>

      <div class="section-title">Need Smore?</div>
      <p>Read the NWC digital <span data-field="smore_newsletter_link">{{ smore_newsletter_link }}</span> for academic and financial aid reminders, campus event notices, and more, sent right to your inbox!</p>
