<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Schedule Planner</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 36pt; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;">SCHEDULE PLANNER</h1>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">
    Use the chart below to help you plan your spring 2022 course schedule. Work with your advisor to make sure you are selecting the courses that will help you reach your academic goals. Remember to make sure you don't select two courses that meet in the same time slots! You might also want to jot down specific time periods in which you'll do homework for each course.
  </div>

