<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 65%;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0;">NORTHWEST CAMPUS CREDENTIAL PROGRAMS</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">NWC is offering campus credentials focused on strengthening skills and building a knowledge base for future careers. These credentials provide students with achievable recognition for completing a few courses toward a specific area of focus, from applied business to cultural knowledge and education.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">The Northwest Campus Advisory Council has approved these credentials to help regional residents strengthen their skills and knowledge in these areas. Students will earn a certificate of completion upon ending their program. Contact us today to learn more!</p>

      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px;">APPLIED BUSINESS:</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">Interested in building your office skills or expanding your knowledge to supervision and management? Check out these campus credentials:</p>
      <ul style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li><span data-field="credential_program_1">{{ credential_program_1 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="credential_program_2">{{ credential_program_2 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="credential_program_3">{{ credential_program_3 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="credential_program_4">{{ credential_program_4 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="credential_program_5">{{ credential_program_5 }}</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;">Learn more about Applied Business campus credentials by contacting:</p>
      <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">
        <span data-field="contact_name">{{ contact_name }}</span><br>
        <span data-field="contact_title">{{ contact_title }}</span><br>
        Email: <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span><br>
        Phone: <span data-field="contact_phone">{{ contact_phone }}</span><br>
        Toll-free: <span data-field="contact_toll_free">{{ contact_toll_free }}</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="width: 35%; text-align: center;">
      <img src="placeholder_image_1.png" alt="Image Placeholder" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">Qualified Substitute Teacher students gathered in Nome for a face-to-face Early Childhood course in November 2019.</p>

      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px;">EDUCATION:</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">Whether interested in early childhood or high school, this campus credential will provide base knowledge to get a start in the classroom.</p>

      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px;">CULTURAL KNOWLEDGE:</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">Expand your knowledge of the region through this in-depth look at the culture of the Bering Strait, from traditional dress and language to the history of Alaska schooling.</p>
      <ul style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li><span data-field="credential_program_6">{{ credential_program_6 }}</span></li>
      </ul>

      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px;">CONTACT AN ADVISOR:</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">Email: <span data-field="advisor_email">{{ advisor_email }}</span><br>
      Phone: <span data-field="advisor_phone">{{ advisor_phone }}</span><br>
      Toll-free: <span data-field="advisor_toll_free">{{ advisor_toll_free }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

