    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0;">Find NWC online!</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">Northwest Campus is here for you. Can't visit campus? Find a host of student resources and course information at the Northwest Campus website: <span data-field="nwc_website_url">{{ nwc_website_url }}</span></p>
      <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;">We're on Facebook! Stay informed about financial aid resources, training programs, regional postsecondary events, and opportunities through the UAF Northwest Campus and Bering Strait Higher Education Connection Facebook pages. Search <span data-field="facebook_search_term">{{ facebook_search_term }}</span> and <span data-field="facebook_search_term_2">{{ facebook_search_term_2 }}</span> to join!</p>
      <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;">Follow us on Instagram to stay up to date about activities on campus and online hosted by NWC.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;">Search for <span data-field="instagram_handle">{{ instagram_handle }}</span> to find us!</p>
      <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;">Join NWC on the Remind App. Text <span data-field="remind_number">{{ remind_number }}</span> to join.</p>
      <ul style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 15px;">
        <li>academic reminders</li>
